OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FMisty with possible fog patches
OL,6,Fto start Friday. Variable cloud with a
OL,7,Fchance of morning showers. Some bright
OL,8,For sunny spells through the afternoon.
OL,9,FLight winds.
OL,10,
OL,11,CTonight:FSome clear spells to start
OL,12,Fthe night. Clouding over after
OL,13,Fmidnight and increasingly misty with
OL,14,Fpossible fog. Showery rain possible
OL,15,Flater in night across western areas.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
