OL,4,
OL,5,CSaturday:FGenerally cloudy, with
OL,6,Fpatchy light rain and drizzle.
OL,7,FProbably drier in the afternoon. Light
OL,8,Fwinds with overnight mist likely and
OL,9,Fchance of fog patches. Further rain
OL,10,Fprobable in east overnight.
OL,11,
OL,12,COutlook for Sunday to Tuesday:
OL,13,FGenerally cloudy, with a chance of
OL,14,Foutbreaks of rain and showers. Limited
OL,15,Fclear or bright spells. Light winds
OL,16,Fwith some fog patches likely.
OL,17,FTemperatures near normal.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
